\textbf{Tuning.} A random search over <<len(search)>> of <<n_combos>> XGBoost configurations, each scored honestly, selected learning\_rate=<<best['learning_rate']>>, max\_depth=<<best['max_depth']>>, min\_child\_weight=<<best['min_child_weight']>>, subsample=<<best['subsample']>>, colsample\_bytree=<<best['colsample_bytree']>>, reg\_lambda=<<best['reg_lambda']>> (mean <<f3(search[0]['mean_pr_auc'])>>). All configurations lay within <<f3(float(search[0]['mean_pr_auc']) - float(search[-1]['mean_pr_auc']))>> of each other and below logistic regression; shallow trees dominated, and the tree count chosen by early stopping varied widely between folds (<<trees_gb>> for the best configuration).

